## Maintainer action

1. Close #1279-#1283 as completed repository records.
2. Close epic #1278 and milestone 0.20 as an M0 administrative stop, not as
   implementation of #1284-#1309.
3. Keep #1284-#1309 closed as not planned pending a new explicit decision.
4. Do not create `sd-001`, recruit participants, build the acceptance service,
   or run a paid experiment from this disposition.
5. Keep standalone correctness issue #1311 independent of this decision.

## Separate PP-W-rows proposal

Milestone 0.21, #1254, and #1259 are **deferred**. They are not a continuation
decision and receive no funding or activation from this M0 record. The
proposal may seek separate explicit approval only after preserving its existing
